    landing_faq_title: "Frequently asked questions",
    landing_faq_general_title: "General",
    landing_faq_q1: "What is Gastrometrics?",
    landing_faq_a1: "A costing and operational analysis system for professional kitchens: recipe sheets, ingredient and inventory control, menus, purchase orders, and a financial module that compares your recipes' theoretical cost against your real sales.",
    landing_faq_q2: "Who can use Gastrometrics?",
    landing_faq_a2: "Restaurants, bakeries, catering, and any professional kitchen operation that needs to know the real cost of what it produces.",
    landing_faq_q3: "Does the platform require a permanent internet connection?",
    landing_faq_a3: "Currently yes, since the data model is centralized in the browser. The version with cloud sync is in development.",
    landing_faq_functions_title: "Features",
    landing_faq_q4: "What happens if a supplier raises the price of an ingredient?",
    landing_faq_a4: "When you record a new purchase, the unit cost is updated in the database. The system automatically recalculates the cost of all recipes that use that ingredient.",
    landing_faq_q5: "Can I use different currencies?",
    landing_faq_a5: "Yes, you can configure your preferred currency in Settings to adapt all calculations and reports to your region.",
    landing_faq_q6: "Is it compatible with my POS system?",
    landing_faq_a6: "The financial module lets you import Excel or CSV files from most POS systems. Column mapping is configured only once.",
    landing_faq_plans_title: "Plans and Subscriptions",
    landing_faq_q7: "What does the free version include?",
    landing_faq_a7_prefix: "The {name} plan includes {desc}",
    landing_faq_q8: "What are the paid plans?",
    landing_faq_a8_see_full: "See the full detail at /planes",
    landing_faq_usability_title: "Usability and Security",
    landing_faq_q9: "Is data shared with third parties?",
    landing_faq_a9_before: "No. The information you generate stays on your device or, in the future, on your database instance. It is not sold or transferred to third parties — see",
    landing_faq_q10: "Is it compatible with mobile devices?",
    landing_faq_a10: "Yes, the interface is responsive and works on mobile devices, tablets, and desktop computers.",
    landing_cta_title: "No-commitment evaluation",
