    about_hero_title: "About Gastrometrics",
    about_hero_body1:
      "Gastrometrics is a professional application designed for chefs, restaurants, catering businesses, nutritionists, and cooking enthusiasts. It combines simplicity and advanced functionality so that managing recipes, costs, and ingredients stops being a headache in scattered spreadsheets.",
    about_hero_body2:
      "The number one design priority is ease of use for someone without a financial background — every calculation is designed so you can make good pricing decisions without needing an accountant by your side.",
    about_modules_title: "Everything Gastrometrics does for you",
    about_modules_subtitle: "A tour of every module, from recipe to sale price, and from purchase to report.",
    about_m_fichas_title: "Recipe Sheets",
    about_m_fichas_desc:
      "Document every recipe step by step: ingredients, quantities, procedure, and photo. Gastrometrics automatically calculates the production cost and recommends a sale price, applying professional rounding to the nearest 5.",
    about_m_fichas_point1: "Automatic costing per ingredient and per serving",
    about_m_fichas_point2: "Sale price calculation with configurable profit margin",
    about_m_fichas_point3: "Recipe scaling for any number of diners",
    about_m_ingredientes_title: "Ingredients and Inventory",
    about_m_ingredientes_desc:
      "A central ingredient database with purchase prices, net content, and a waste system, plus an inventory module that logs stock in, stock out, and critical stock levels in real time.",
    about_m_ingredientes_point1: "Conversion between metric and imperial systems with a single switch",
    about_m_ingredientes_point2: "Low or critical stock alerts",
    about_m_ingredientes_point3: "Full history of recorded inventories",
    about_m_menus_title: "Menus",
    about_m_menus_desc:
      "Build complete menus by course (starter, main, dessert, and whichever ones you need) by combining recipes you already have saved — ideal both for a restaurant's menu and for an event with a fixed guest list.",
    about_m_menus_point1: "Menu courses consistent with your recipe sheets' classification",
    about_m_menus_point2: "Several dish options per course",
    about_m_menus_point3: "Consolidated price and cost for the whole menu",
    about_m_ordenes_title: "Purchase Orders",
    about_m_ordenes_desc:
      "Generate shopping lists from what your recipes actually need, with status tracking (pending, approved, ordered, received) and an overview of which ingredients are the most used, the most expensive, and the ones weighing most on your inventory.",
    about_m_ordenes_point1: "Duplicate past orders in one click",
    about_m_ordenes_point2: "Purchasing insights: most used, most expensive, most spent on inventory",
    about_m_ordenes_point3: "Export to share with suppliers",
    about_m_estadisticas_title: "Statistics and Reports",
    about_m_estadisticas_desc:
      "A complete overview of your operation: recipes by classification, profit margins, inventory value, and which ingredients drive your business the most — all in one place, with no manual spreadsheets.",
    about_m_estadisticas_point1: "Best margin and lowest margin among your recipes",
    about_m_estadisticas_point2: "Average cost % and average margin for the business",
    about_m_estadisticas_point3: "Ingredient overview by usage, spend, and price",
    about_m_multinegocio_title: "Multi-business",
    about_m_multinegocio_desc:
      "Manage several restaurants, branches, or brands from a single account. Each business has its own catalog, operating expenses, and pricing calculator, completely independent, except when you decide to migrate a recipe from one to another.",
    about_m_multinegocio_point1: "Real monthly expenses automatically applied to each recipe's costing",
    about_m_multinegocio_point2: "Recipe migration between businesses, including ingredients and sub-recipes",
    about_m_multinegocio_point3: "Main dashboard separate from each business's dashboard",
    about_m_costeo_title: "Cost Calculation",
    about_m_costeo_desc:
      "The heart of Gastrometrics: six costing categories (rent, utilities, marketing, operations, staff, net profit) applied on top of production cost, with a single rounding at the end so the sale price is always a clean number.",
    about_m_costeo_point1: "100% configurable costing categories per recipe",
    about_m_costeo_point2: "A single rounding, up to the nearest 5, on the final price",
    about_m_costeo_point3: "Optional tax (VAT), with no logic tied to a single country",
    about_m_multiidioma_title: "Multi-language and multi-currency",
    about_m_multiidioma_desc:
      "Built for Central America and beyond: it supports the currencies of the whole region (plus USD, Euro, and Yuan), and the interface is available in Spanish, English, Danish, French, Portuguese, and Chinese.",
    about_m_multiidioma_point1: "Switch currency from Settings without losing your data",
    about_m_multiidioma_point2: "Independent language selector per user",
    about_view_detail: "See full detail with screenshots",
    about_cta_title: "Ready to leave spreadsheets behind?",
    about_cta_subtitle: "Start free with the Foodie plan, or compare all plans to find the one that fits your operation.",
    about_cta_button1: "Start for Free",
    about_cta_button2: "View Plans",
